            <ArticleTitle>Cardiovascular effects of alcohol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>430-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The effects of alcohol on the heart include modification of the risk of coronary artery disease, the development of alcoholic cardiomyopathy, exacerbation of conduction disorders, atrial and ventricular dysrhythmias, and an increased risk of hypertension, hemorrhagic stroke, infectious endocarditis, and fetal heart abnormalities.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
